00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:56,830
But now that I'm in your arms,
I think I can catch...

357
00:22:56,830 --> 00:23:01,800
...your pounding heartbeat this time.

358
00:23:01,800 --> 00:23:07,310
Nobody else matters...
All we have to do is gaze at each other.

359
00:23:07,310 --> 00:23:12,720
It's all right for your heart to flutter...
All we have to do is love each other.

360
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:17,720
Open your heart, and
ride that favorable wind.

361
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:23,260
Don't run away from happiness.

362
00:23:23,860 --> 00:23:28,770
I'll always be waiting for you.

363
00:23:28,770 --> 00:23:33,970
So come rest your wings anytime.

364
00:23:33,970 --> 00:23:38,980
It's all right to cry...
anytime you need to.

365
00:23:38,980 --> 00:23:44,620
I just want to see you again...
All we have to do is love each other.

366
00:23:44,620 --> 00:23:49,590
Open your heart, and
ride that favorable wind.

367
00:23:49,590 --> 00:23:55,190
I just want you to be happy.

368
00:23:56,060 --> 00:23:59,500
..ذلك الذي كان من الممكن أن يصنع
..يدعى بـ الآلة

369
00:23:59,500 --> 00:24:03,470
آلةٌ بلا قلب تكسب
.روحاً بفضل حبها للآلهة

370
00:24:03,470 --> 00:24:07,070
الحلقة القادمة: آه! الآلهة سرقت
قلبك

371
00:24:07,070 --> 00:24:10,830
كم سيكلفني ثمن فاتورة الكهرباء
لهذا الشيء كل شهر؟